Subject: [PATCH 01/44] firmware/ivc: use dma_mapping_error
Date: Thu,  8 Jun 2017 15:25:26 +0200
Message-Id: <20170608132609.32662-2-hch@lst.de>
In-Reply-To: <20170608132609.32662-1-hch@lst.de>
